Z||000006||85Josh||05-14-2001||11:17 PM||||Jhonny, that is indeed the guage sender. My book lists a part number for the bushing: 10037037 for the 2.8 engine. Good luck.<P>------------------<BR>85 2M4(Lil' Bit)||||reg||1
